id: pm-swarm-journal-api
title: Adopt public SDK transaction journal inspection when available
description: "Replace the read-only SDK journal compatibility adapter with a typed host-bound transaction status/inspection API when upstream pm-cli#1597 supplies one. Preserve deterministic identity, exact native version/hash checks, whole-document admission and copied-message retry regressions. The current implementation uses public readFileIfExists at the documented SDK journal location; commitWorkspaceTransaction remains its sole writer and coordinator."
